{"metadata":{"title":"article(_:)","roleHeading":"Function","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"symbolKind":"func","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"article","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ItemTrait","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto9ItemTraitV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Gnusto7articleyAA9ItemTraitVSSF"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/article(_:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/BootstrapError","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/BootstrapError\/diagnostics","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent\/namespace","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Game\/content","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Game\/verbs","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Game\/actions","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Game\/timers","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Game\/maxScore","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScoreDeclaring","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScoreDeclaring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SyntaxRule","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/firstSight(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/properName","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/pronoun(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/alwaysDescribed"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"article","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"word","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ItemTrait","text":"ItemTrait","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto9ItemTraitV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"word","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The article to use, such as “a” or “an”."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The article trait.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextAndRandomness"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without it the engine reads the first letter, which is right for almost every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"name and wrong for the handful whose spelling and sound disagree. Declared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than listed, because an exception list is a dictionary the engine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would have to keep, and a game knows its own nouns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It reaches only the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"indefinite","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" article, so it changes a room listing, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inventory line and every other “a …” the engine renders, and nothing about","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“the …”. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/properName","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/plural","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" still outrank it: a proper name takes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no article at all and a plural one takes “some”, so declaring this beside","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"either is a bootstrap warning rather than a third opinion. A blank word is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fatal diagnostic, with every other blank author-facing text.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The word itself is not validated against a list of real articles: whatever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"is passed renders verbatim in front of the name, so a typo here reaches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the transcript unchanged.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/article(_:)"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The indefinite article this name takes, for the names English spells one way","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and says another: ","type":"text"},{"code":"article(\"an\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on an hour glass, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"article(\"a\")"},{"type":"text","text":" on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"unicorn.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Game/timers":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/game\/timers","title":"timers","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Game\/timers","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timers","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The game’s fuses and daemons: named timed events whose bodies run at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the end of turns.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","required":true,"defaultIm